sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor
    participant Browser
    participant Food as FoodListingController
    participant DB as food_listings
    participant NS as NotificationService

    Donor->>Browser: Post food form
    Browser->>Food: POST /food
    Food->>Food: Validate + copy donor lat/lng
    Food->>DB: INSERT status AVAILABLE moderation PENDING or APPROVED
    opt listing approved for search
        Food->>NS: notify nearby recipients
    end
    Food-->>Browser: Redirect /food/mine
